- **`packages/daemon/test/endo.test.js`:** new test `SortedMapStore and SortedSetStore apply exact scan bounds`. It covers prefix keys at an exclusive start and an inclusive end for both store types, a start bound below the pattern's rank range being clamped, and rejection of a mistyped bounds record.

